			"description": "<ul><li>Users can add websites, servers, or services to monitor their availability and performance</li><li>This includes creating monitors for various types like HTTP/S, Ping, Port, and Docker containers</li><li>The system periodically checks the status, response time, and SSL certificate validity of these services</li><li>Results are visualized on a dashboard, showing at-a-glance if services are up or down</li><li>Monitoring intervals are configurable by the user</li></ul>",
